{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:719","content":{"id":719,"title":"买卖股票的最佳时机 II","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"f710ccfe-5fb0-4e03-a1da-392535ccf872","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a99d6f1-d4cc-46f5-bf33-2fd05bc90633","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prices"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prices[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示某支股票第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 天的价格。在每一天，你可以决定是否购买和/或出售股票。你在任何时候"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"最多"},{"type":"formatted","text":"只能持有"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"一股"},{"type":"formatted","text":"股票。你也可以先购买，然后在"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"同一天"},{"type":"formatted","text":"出售。返回你能获得的最大利润。"}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 1","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"9229ae2c-fe61-4cd6-ace9-0e46549ceb7d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"32e35551-8f0a-423e-a951-36685fc5c88c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prices = [7,1,5,3,6,4]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ec6fd19-f51f-4f9c-87aa-8b671e9232ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"7"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a139e928-5cf9-45a2-be84-771eca99bd14","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：在第 2 天（股票价格 = 1）的时候买入，在第 3 天（股票价格 = 5）的时候卖出, 这笔交易所能获得利润 = 5 - 1 = 4。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0de250f9-647c-4c58-85cb-9fe002b0f4b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随后，在第 4 天（股票价格 = 3）的时候买入，在第 5 天（股票价格 = 6）的时候卖出, 这笔交易所能获得利润 = 6 - 3 = 3。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1420625f-9a03-40d5-99f2-a277e9fe194d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最大总利润为 4 + 3 = 7 。"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 2","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"73f6aa0b-6b6c-49e4-8b73-6e581464a3fb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1268250-31c0-463c-81e5-f34908d86a2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prices = [1,2,3,4,5]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"21839600-aca8-4a69-8efe-94b80b3e995b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出：4"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"004b2a69-8b86-4039-9431-b9ad4b8d6e59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：在第 1 天（股票价格 = 1）的时候买入，在第 5 天 （股票价格 = 5）的时候卖出, 这笔交易所能获得利润 = 5 - 1 = 4。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b828e69-fd44-438e-aaff-9b12be895c85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最大总利润为 4 。"}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 3","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"ef459517-dc50-44a4-9fd5-2ee88206f386","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35b30161-f6cf-4d79-ad88-d719d876bd47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prices = [7,6,4,3,1]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c4a71629-8cd6-46fc-b50d-27a048b00e2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出：0"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"086f86be-213d-44e8-a13e-7110016183c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解释：在这种情况下, 交易无法获得正利润，所以不参与交易可以获得最大利润，最大利润为 0。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"48558eea-411a-4b9e-8587-64f571cbd5cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"09671650-2211-489a-8cd5-19e6f52cdcd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态规划"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49153af2-cb5c-4b42-aff5-60b803903ca9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i][0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 天手里有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 支股票时能够获得的最大收益，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i][1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 天手里有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 支股票时能获得的最大收益，可以得到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i][0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i][1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的递推公式"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{dp}[i][0] &= \\max\\{ \\text{dp}[i - 1][0], \\text{dp}[i - 1] + \\text{prices}[i] \\} \\\\\n\\text{dp}[i][1] &= \\max\\{ \\text{dp}[i - 1][0] - \\text{prices}[i], \\text{dp}[i - 1][1] \\}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"5465cfae-e31d-4a28-87d8-01784c70bf57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"607663e0-1c4b-459b-91d8-0a0937456a51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可知 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[0][0] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[0][1] = -prices[0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，求 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[n - 1][0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"1a00432b-207e-4d0d-a287-c0c8e6753b70","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6d886d8c-fd7f-4b94-8efa-dd3b96995380","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function maxProfit(prices: number[]): number {\n    const n = prices.length;\n    if (n <= 1) return 0;\n    const dp = Array.from({ length: n }).fill([0, 0]);\n    dp[0][0] = 0;\n    dp[0][1] = -prices[0];\n\n    for (let i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        dp[i][0] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][0], dp[i - 1][1] + prices[i]);\n        dp[i][1] = Math.max(dp[i - 1][0] - prices[i], dp[i - 1][1]);\n    }\n\n    return dp[n - 1][0];\n};","collabId":"1d440ec3-0892-44fe-b68e-ca52a48c30bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"744e7df5-5a31-4c58-b366-b27ecc82c3fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于每次 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的迭代只用了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i - 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此不需要一个数组，只需要两个变量即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"56930b63-0f46-4100-92ab-3dbadb34892c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3296f318-5b43-40dd-b878-f48644c3bbc4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function maxProfit(prices: number[]): number {\n    const n = prices.length;\n    if (n <= 1) return 0;\n    let noStock = 0;\n    let oneStock = -prices[0];\n\n    for (const price of prices) {\n        const newNoStock = Math.max(noStock, oneStock + price);\n        const newOneStock = Math.max(noStock - price, oneStock);\n        noStock = newNoStock;\n        oneStock = newOneStock;\n    }\n\n    return noStock;\n};","collabId":"6132d539-cb37-41c7-9cc7-fd8f8e934f0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c8b9cf40-ed65-43f9-b1a2-0fc549819237","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"贪心"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8be43e65-f191-46b4-b87e-59c2f7deb9c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为不限制交易次数，因此只要能收割到所有收益获得的利益就是最大化的，只要有的赚就卖出去（卖出去还可以今天在买回来）"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"f1f64764-5ed0-4be0-a353-514c5c13f5bf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6816c6a8-30ef-44f6-8c48-559b198f23ff","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function maxProfit(prices: number[]): number {\n    const n = prices.length;\n    if (n <= 1) return 0;\n    \n    let maxProfit = 0;\n    for (let i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        const profit = prices[i] - prices[i - 1];\n        if (profit > 0) {\n            maxProfit += profit;\n        }\n    }\n\n    return maxProfit;\n};","collabId":"f1015840-a68f-415f-94fb-a5788e570c55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"动态规划"},{"label":"买卖股票的最佳时机 II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:719","type":"doc","id":719}}],"prevPage":{"title":"最小路径和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:712","type":"doc","id":712}},"nextPage":{"title":"单词搜索","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:688","type":"doc","id":688}},"createTime":1729127264203,"updateTime":1744296758938,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296758938}}